    "title": "Special Weather Statement by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "17 minutes ago Check NWS updates here\nEffective: 2025-09-03 23:14:00 CDT Expires: 2025-09-03 23:45:00 CDT Urgency: Expected Severity: Moderate Certainty: Observed Instruction: If outdoors, consider seeking shelter inside a building. Target Area: Miller At 1114 PM CDT, Doppler radar was tracking a strong thunderstorm over Eldon, moving southeast at 45 mph.\nHAZARD...Wind gusts up to 50 mph and nickel size hail.\nSOURCE...Radar indicated.\nIMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around unsecured objects. Minor hail damage to vegetation is possible.\nLocations impacted include... Eldon, St. Elizabeth, Tuscumbia, Eugene, Olean, Etterville, Marys Home, and Aurora Springs.",
